	quest.10B2A79E0E5AA34A.quest_desc: ["From &bMV&r and beyond, the machine hulls of each tier require polymers in addition to metal plates. The first of these polymers is &6Bakelite&r, a Phenol-Formaldehyde Resin mixed with a filler of Sawdust or Asbestos fibers. This thermosetting resin will also be required to produce &6Phenolic Circuit Boards&r for &bMV&r Circuits."]
