	quest.1E20BEBB0C3931F8.quest_desc: [
		"The primary ore of &3Aluminium&r is &eBauxite&r. The conversion of Bauxite Ore to metallic Aluminium is the first required complex ore processing chain of this pack."
		""
		"A Bauxite line more familiar to GTM players is unlocked in &6HV&r, but the &7LV&r processing line to convert &eBauxite Dust&r into the &3Alumina Dust&r required for &3Aluminium&r production begins in an &7LV Autoclave&r."
	]
