	quest.378DD563D8569400.quest_desc: [
		"Unlike standard GTM, you will require &6Sulfuric Acid&r to progress to &bMV&r, as it is required to produce the &dHydrofluoric Acid&r necessary for Aluminium production. Each of these paths is outlined on the following page. The Lead Chamber Process is the most renewable and efficient method, while the other two are simpler, but more costly and less efficient. Processes II and III produce &eSulfur Trioxide&r, which can be mixed with Water to produce &6Sulfuric Acid&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&9I -&r The Lead Chamber Process, this 3/4 step process is the most renewable and efficient option available to you at this stage. It requires a starting supply of &6Sulfuric Acid&r which can be produced by mixing &eSulfur Trioxide&r obtained through either of the other two methods with Water."
		""
		"&9II -&r Sulfuric Acid by Saltpeter, this process produces &eSulfur Trioxide&r from a reaction of Saltpeter and Sulfur Dust in the presence of Air or Oxygen. The &bNitric Oxide&r produced by this process will also come in handy to kickstart the &9Lead Chamber Process&r reaction."
		""
		"&9III -&r Sulfuric Acid by Pyrite, this multi-step process begins with a reaction of Pyrite Dust, Oxygen, and Water to produce &aAcidic Green Vitriol&r which can be converted to Ferrous Sulfate Dust, then roasted to release &eSulfur Dioxide&r and &eSulfur Trioxide&r."
	]
	quest.378DD563D8569400.quest_subtitle: "Three Routes"
